he buffer and its blender are never changed, and ImageBuffer's own solid blends keep their C++ premultiplied contract. The SVG renderer, whose layers are genuinely premultiplied and whose paint is already premultiplied, fills through ScanlineRenderer directly. ThemeTokenDefaultsTests hashes re-captured (buffered render now equals direct render). New tests: ImageGraphics2DTranslucentFillTests (straight result on straight and premultiplied buffers; a translucent fill and a partly covered edge on a transparent backbuffer composite like a direct draw; the fill honours the clipping rect) and MarkdownTableGridTests.StripedRowsPaintBetweenTheGridLines.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"StoDevX/AAO-React-Native","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:40Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"e1260ac93ab441456f6ed8c58b7f180f5132708c","github_link":"https://github.com/StoDevX/AAO-React-Native/commit/e1260ac93ab441456f6ed8c58b7f180f5132708c","commit_subject":"Add Support and Developer screens, and fill Home's menu","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lowdefy/lowdefy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:27Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"0f1ec4f1d83e1e61f2fd8de9046f5aea3e47f82e","github_link":"https://github.com/lowdefy/lowdefy/commit/0f1ec4f1d83e1e61f2fd8de9046f5aea3e47f82e","commit_subject":"Merge #2553 (ci: Run the unit tests on Windows) into ci/v7-fast-ci","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lowdefy/lowdefy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:26Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"ae66e446ca4a93bd937ba065e03fbe2f3404a4e6","github_link":"https://github.com/lowdefy/lowdefy/commit/ae66e446ca4a93bd937ba065e03fbe2f3404a4e6","commit_subject":"ci: Fast affected-only tests on pull requests, full matrix before a release","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"lowdefy/lowdefy","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:47:26Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"147c998be516cda469564207ea8a5e7ca82e119d","github_link":"https://github.com/lowdefy/lowdefy/commit/147c998be516cda469564207ea8a5e7ca82e119d","commit_subje